{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa"},{"kind":"text","text":" { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAAA","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/requirementsaaa"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"requirementsAAA"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa"}],"title":"requirementsAAA","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}],"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV15requirementsAAASb7textual_Sb10nonTextualtvp"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AAA level needs to have textual component matching 7:1 contrast ratio"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is recommended for mobiles devices projects (because of screen sizes and luminosity issues)."}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"ic_layers.png":{"type":"image","alt":null,"identifier":"ic_layers.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png","traits":["1x","light"]}]},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio"}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance","isActive":true}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/WCAG21Requirements":{"identifier